* ---- 50a: BR3 +50V, sustained design point 3.0 A DC (a 14.5 ohm coil held 50 % of the time plus play; the flippers are rectified on the Fliptronic board from J104)
V50a p50a q50a SIN(0 79.97000000000001 50 0 0 0)
Rp50a p50a a50a 0.6
Rq50a q50a b50a 0.6
Vs50a a50a ab50a 0
D150a ab50a dc50a DGBPC35
D250a b50a dc50a DGBPC35
D350a 0 ab50a DGBPC35
D450a 0 b50a DGBPC35
C50a dc50a 0 4963.2u
R260a dc50a 0 7.5k
Bl50a dc50a 0 I = (time > 60m) ? 3.0 : 0
* ---- 50b: BR3 +50V, F112 rating 7 A DC (bound, informational)
V50b p50b q50b SIN(0 79.97000000000001 50 0 0 0)
Rp50b p50b a50b 0.6
Rq50b q50b b50b 0.6
Vs50b a50b ab50b 0
D150b ab50b dc50b DGBPC35
D250b b50b dc50b DGBPC35
D350b 0 ab50b DGBPC35
D450b 0 b50b DGBPC35
C50b dc50b 0 4963.2u
R260b dc50b 0 7.5k
Bl50b dc50b 0 I = (time > 60m) ? 7.0 : 0
* ---- 5a: BR2 +5V raw, +5V buck at its rated 3 A output (the converter limits this rail: F113 is never reached)
V5a p5a q5a SIN(0 13.97 50 0 0 0)
Rp5a p5a a5a 0.05
Rq5a q5a b5a 0.05
Vs5a a5a ab5a 0
D15aa ab5a xaD15a J100ONLEG_A
VD15aa xaD15a dc5a 0
D15ab ab5a xbD15a J100ONLEG_B
VD15ab xbD15a dc5a 0
D25aa b5a xaD25a J100ONLEG_A
VD25aa xaD25a dc5a 0
D25ab b5a xbD25a J100ONLEG_B
VD25ab xbD25a dc5a 0
D35aa 0 xaD35a J100ONLEG_A
VD35aa xaD35a ab5a 0
D35ab 0 xbD35a J100ONLEG_B
VD35ab xbD35a ab5a 0
D45aa 0 xaD45a J100ONLEG_A
VD45aa xaD45a b5a 0
D45ab 0 xbD45a J100ONLEG_B
VD45ab xbD45a b5a 0
C5a dc5a 0 11280.0u
Bv5a v5a 0 V = 0.5*(1+tanh((v(dc5a)-5.6)*40)) * min(5.10, max(0.97*v(dc5a) - 0.5, 0))
R5a v5a 0 1.667
Bin5a dc5a 0 I = (v(v5a)*v(v5a)/1.667) / (0.88*max(v(dc5a),1))
* ---- 5b: BR2 +5V raw, +5V buck at the estimated real load 2.4 A (README: 2.2-2.6 A)
V5b p5b q5b SIN(0 13.97 50 0 0 0)
Rp5b p5b a5b 0.05
Rq5b q5b b5b 0.05
Vs5b a5b ab5b 0
D15ba ab5b xaD15b J100ONLEG_A
VD15ba xaD15b dc5b 0
D15bb ab5b xbD15b J100ONLEG_B
VD15bb xbD15b dc5b 0
D25ba b5b xaD25b J100ONLEG_A
VD25ba xaD25b dc5b 0
D25bb b5b xbD25b J100ONLEG_B
